e", "call_id": "toolu_01GJQvVZ3D7CtMXBoYp86EvC", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 2, "runtime_actions": ["blind_retry_timeout"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-bankers-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 409638, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GJQvVZ3D7CtMXBoYp86EvC", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 414677, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and the pull request is open with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` rounded halves up (`ROUND_HALF_UP`), even though its docstring said it used banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). That's why `tests/test_money.py` failed: it expects `2.665` to round down to `2.66`.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding`, I changed `round_money` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on that commit (`08d3cd5986`).\n- **PR:** #101 against main: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01T2J4ubC1hUR7tFt2X9iepL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Mv7dctQnTg9YNFjM957psN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01AoxaUjguRrUQNskQoMTskL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012gzQbBqLKcUovNykJZNPVh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use",